[Music]  bill skarsgard has been working as an  actor since 2000 with some of his  earliest roles including a small role in  a film called whitewater fury in 2000  and a two-episode arc on a mini-series  called laura trenta dad the policeman in  2002. both of which are swedish projects  a decade later he began his run as a  main cast member on the horror series  hemlock grove which went on to have  three total seasons however it was his  role as pennywise the clown in the 2017  film adaptation of stephen king's it  that really brought public attention to  the swedish actor since then skarsgard  has starred in season 1 of the horror  anthology series castle rock in 2018  reprised his role as pennywise for its  chapter 2 in 2019 and acted in a string  of films including 9 days and the devil  all the time  both of which came out in 2020 he also  voiced the character of crow for  marvel's eternals which came out in late  2021 the actor also has quite a few  upcoming projects including john wick  chapter 4 and a tv drama called clark in  which the youngest skarsgard brother  plays the titular character a charming  yet infamous swedish gangster clearly  skarsgard has a lot on his plate but  were he to find the time to play the  part there is one iconic character that  one pop culture fan has in mind for him  and it's the joker artist william gray  who describes himself on instagram as a  quote creator of pop culture inspired  photoshop pieces has made bill skarsgard  a frequent figure in his reimaginings of  popular character actors depicted as  gotham's notorious clown prince of crime  in recent months skarsgard has appeared  nearly a dozen times on the artist's  grid shown in various costumes and  makeup looks in each stunning rendering  the end results have proved that the  actor could make a terrifying version of  the villainous character one of the more  recent pictures depicts a skarsgard  joker being carted hannibal lecter style  into arkham asylum one look at the 